#: ../../maths/quanto.md ../../maths/quanto.md:1
#: 10300e0e67e6401ab0c6d1c1c2370197 3263935b105c47e6965d22795cb40c7c
msgid "Quanto"
msgstr "Quanto"

#: ../../maths/quanto.md:3 3ab7c43c8d8b4de39cadd63cee00f8bb
msgid ""
"A quanto option pays in a currency other than the underlying's, converted"
" at a **fixed** rate. The holder gets the option's payoff in domestic "
"currency without the FX exposure — which is not free, because the hedge "
"for the option has to be run in the foreign asset and unwound at a moving"
" exchange rate."
msgstr "quanto 選擇權以標的計價幣別以外的貨幣給付，並以一個**固定**匯率換算。持有者拿到的是以本國貨幣計價的選擇權收益，且不承擔匯率曝險——而這並非免費，因為這檔選擇權的避險必須在外幣資產上執行，再以浮動的匯率平倉。"

#: ../../maths/quanto.md:8 af9804b505e84c708e5f9fc70bc86397
msgid "The adjustment"
msgstr "調整項"

#: ../../maths/quanto.md:10 74ae385e246441c2a957ad26fdf3d13f
msgid ""
"Under the domestic risk-neutral measure the foreign asset's drift picks "
"up a covariance term. Writing $r_d$ for the domestic rate, $r_f$ for the "
"foreign rate, $\\sigma_X$ for the volatility of the exchange rate and "
"$\\rho$ for the correlation between the asset and that rate, the asset "
"drifts at"
msgstr "在本國風險中立測度下，外幣資產的漂移會多出一個共變異項。以 $r_d$ 表示本國利率、$r_f$ 表示外幣利率、$\\sigma_X$ 表示匯率的波動率、$\\rho$ 表示資產與該匯率之間的相關係數，資產的漂移為"

#: ../../maths/quanto.md:15 852875fa816b4eab8045d5333895afc9
msgid "b_{\\text{quanto}} = r_f - q - \\rho\\,\\sigma\\,\\sigma_X"
msgstr ""

#: ../../maths/quanto.md:17 647196465f944a34baa062567c8d1208
msgid ""
"instead of $r - q$. Everything else about the option is unchanged, which "
"is why quanto is not a product in this schema: it is a change of drift, "
"and it therefore composes over any style whose engine is built from a "
"process alone."
msgstr "而不是 $r - q$。選擇權的其他一切都沒有改變，這也是為什麼 quanto 在這份結構描述中不是一種商品：它是漂移的變更，因此能疊加在任何「引擎只需一個隨機過程即可建構」的類型上。"

#: ../../maths/quanto.md:21 55d4942694fe4c0d853e9a8fe1072624
msgid ""
"QuantLib implements exactly that by wrapping the *dividend* term "
"structure (`ql/termstructures/yield/quantotermstructure.hpp`):"
msgstr "QuantLib 正是藉由包住*股利*期限結構來實作它（`ql/termstructures/yield/quantotermstructure.hpp`）："

#: ../../maths/quanto.md:24 8d01e9dfa9f9452bb813ba28c85952ba
msgid ""
"q_{\\text{quanto}}(t) = q(t) + r_d(t) - r_f(t) + "
"\\rho\\,\\sigma\\,\\sigma_X,"
msgstr ""

#: ../../maths/quanto.md:26 44350ec67ffc404eb5e6c9927ab02a98
msgid ""
"so that $r_d - q_{\\text{quanto}} = r_f - q - \\rho\\sigma\\sigma_X$, "
"which is the line above. The engine then prices the ordinary option "
"against that adjusted process and discounts at the domestic rate."
msgstr "如此一來 $r_d - q_{\\text{quanto}} = r_f - q - \\rho\\sigma\\sigma_X$，也就是上面那一行。引擎接著以這個調整過的過程為普通選擇權計價，並以本國利率折現。"

#: ../../maths/quanto.md:30 e6f53e41bd1849c9b20173da98c9eef6
msgid "Reading the sign"
msgstr "解讀正負號"

#: ../../maths/quanto.md:32 d87e2d03d04e49bc9bee19ce5818423c
msgid ""
"The correlation term is the whole of the quanto effect, and its sign is "
"the part that trips people up."
msgstr "相關係數這一項就是 quanto 效應的全部，而它的正負號正是最容易讓人絆倒的地方。"

#: ../../maths/quanto.md:35 cc7a53e07dc446f8b226f36ca538ec06
msgid ""
"$\\rho > 0$ — the asset rises when the foreign currency strengthens. The "
"hedger is long the asset in a currency that is getting more expensive to "
"convert back at the fixed rate, so the drift is reduced and a **call is "
"worth less**."
msgstr "$\\rho > 0$——外幣走強時資產上漲。避險者持有的是一檔以「換回時越來越貴」的貨幣計價的資產，而換回的匯率是固定的，因此漂移被壓低，**買權變便宜**。"

#: ../../maths/quanto.md:39 380a0f6e6005426e905094dc9a239415
msgid "$\\rho < 0$ — the reverse; a call is worth more."
msgstr "$\\rho < 0$——反過來；買權變貴。"

#: ../../maths/quanto.md:40 0b4ed546cc724ca78047c8cfb944a0b8
msgid ""
"$\\rho = 0$ — the adjustment vanishes and only the rate substitution $r "
"\\to r_f$ remains."
msgstr "$\\rho = 0$——調整項消失，只剩下把利率換成 $r \\to r_f$ 這件事。"

#: ../../maths/quanto.md:43 1d32b4af64f14513a965b4471efbea86
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The size of it is $\\rho\\sigma\\sigma_X T$ in the log-drift: with a 25% "
"asset vol, a 12% FX vol and correlation 0.3, that is about 0.9% per year "
"of drift — small, but not small enough to ignore on a long-dated trade."
msgstr "它在對數漂移中的大小是 $\\rho\\sigma\\sigma_X T$：資產波動率 25%、匯率波動率 12%、相關係數 0.3，大約是每年 0.9% 的漂移——不大，但在長天期交易上還沒小到可以忽略。"

#: ../../maths/quanto.md:47 d462b0978f61406f9a5ce64fcd16c5b4
msgid "What you have to supply"
msgstr "你必須提供什麼"

#: ../../maths/quanto.md:49 b828054d49544d7c8470bac5eb6b7921
msgid ""
"All three of an FX risk-free curve, an FX volatility and a correlation. "
"The interface will not let you send a partial quanto: two of the three is"
" not a cheaper approximation, it is a different model."
msgstr "外匯無風險曲線、外匯波動率與相關係數三者齊備。介面不會讓你送出殘缺的 quanto：三者取其二不是比較便宜的近似，而是另一個模型。"

#: ../../maths/quanto.md:53 ffaa081fb7ed46efbbce4b20955ae834
msgid "Where it composes, and where it does not"
msgstr "哪些類型能疊加，哪些不能"

#: ../../maths/quanto.md c98f03dfb0c249cc88e04f42bb3bb336
msgid "Style"
msgstr "類型"

#: ../../maths/quanto.md 3c5eb309f2724564ac96e825a97e42c4
msgid "vanilla"
msgstr "一般型"

#: ../../maths/quanto.md 512ad94939ce40b6b508071b0575f306
#: cfc9b069dae44210b994a818d9f843bd
msgid "yes — analytic or FD, European"
msgstr "可以——解析解或有限差分，歐式"

#: ../../maths/quanto.md a67962c8155c47ef881b1b1355ba9253
msgid "barrier"
msgstr "障礙"

#: ../../maths/quanto.md 07d36479a0504c219d90162b4927cb96
msgid "double barrier"
msgstr "雙障礙"

#: ../../maths/quanto.md d7844d07e293450f813226c244acd754
msgid "yes — analytic"
msgstr "可以——解析解"

#: ../../maths/quanto.md f74cd8e1522849f8b45ca93484a09464
msgid "forward start"
msgstr "遠期起始"

#: ../../maths/quanto.md b412a6223d3540d39e250a69eda63a5e
msgid "yes"
msgstr "可以"

#: ../../maths/quanto.md e01e71602c1c442bbadd14d9d8c64aa9
msgid "Asian"
msgstr "亞式"

#: ../../maths/quanto.md 1c38f1ea9d004ab1a9db95b394be81c2
msgid "**no** — QuantLib has no quanto Asian engine"
msgstr "**不行**——QuantLib 沒有 quanto 亞式引擎"

#: ../../maths/quanto.md 88188add8afb4cd29395e69f8feabbb9
msgid "lookback"
msgstr "回顧式"

#: ../../maths/quanto.md a6e4a30312a246cf8d6394ba435b0add
msgid "**no** — refused by name"
msgstr "**不行**——被指名拒絕"

#: ../../maths/quanto.md:64 57405c7368fc4240bd14dc770ce69168
msgid ""
"The lookback row has history worth knowing. This build used to price a "
"quanto lookback as a *plain* lookback and report no error at all — the "
"wrapper was silently dropped. The service refuses it by name now, and "
"says so in the `Capabilities` it answers `Hello` with, so a client can "
"rule the combination out before it costs a round trip."
msgstr ""

#: ../../maths/quanto.md:70 16283b6bd1ff4d79b637ae3e82676ee5
msgid ""
"Under quanto, a finite-difference request takes one of the three grid "
"presets rather than an explicit size: the wrapper constructs its inner "
"engine from a process alone, so each grid is a separate compiled type and"
" an arbitrary pair has nowhere to go."
msgstr "在 quanto 之下，有限差分請求只能挑三個預設網格之一而不能指定尺寸：包裝器只用一個隨機過程建構內層引擎，因此每一組網格都是一個獨立編譯出來的型別，任意的一對尺寸無處可去。"

#: ../../maths/quanto.md:75 97d844cba9f24f2884d06fca783dca5c
msgid "The quanto greeks"
msgstr "quanto 的希臘字母"

#: ../../maths/quanto.md:77 29a40def3f1841e0a87a88feaf5340d1
msgid ""
"Three result kinds exist only for these trades, and they are the "
"derivatives of the adjustment itself:"
msgstr "有三種結果只存在於這類交易，而它們正是調整項本身的導數："

#: ../../maths/quanto.md:80 394d61add6a04ceba223fa361145f9f9
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\text{qrho} = \\frac{\\partial V}{\\partial r_f},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\text{qvega} = \\frac{\\partial V}{\\partial \\sigma_X},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\text{qlambda} = \\frac{\\partial V}{\\partial \\rho}."
msgstr ""

#: ../../maths/quanto.md:86 ce420668239a4465ba0619793d698b5b
msgid ""
"Since $\\rho$, $\\sigma_X$ and $r_f$ enter only through "
"$b_{\\text{quanto}}$, all three are proportional to the trade's "
"sensitivity to the carry — qlambda in particular is $-\\sigma\\sigma_X$ "
"times it. On a non-quanto trade they come back named absent rather than "
"zero."
msgstr "由於 $\\rho$、$\\sigma_X$ 與 $r_f$ 只透過 $b_{\\text{quanto}}$ 進入模型，這三者都與該筆交易對持有成本的敏感度成正比——尤其 qlambda 就是它的 $-\\sigma\\sigma_X$ 倍。在非 quanto 交易上，它們回來時被指名為缺席，而不是零。"

